# The Pmacs stage of the screenshots (tour.script's header): a session of
# its own, as `simpos_live.py live --start login --program exshow` starts
# one.  exshow's 1100 x 700 window does not fit the save memory over the
# debugger's windows (winfb BADSAVE, a refusal), so it comes after Login
# PIMOS only, as the pin pmacs_editor.script does.
click r 640 560
click r 640 560
click l 978 605
quiet
start exshow
# the window selected by a click; a line typed above the file's first,
# then C-p C-e, a Backspace and `!` at its end
click l 200 150
type Hello, SIMPOS.
key enter
ctrlkey p
ctrlkey e
key bs
type !
quiet
# stage pmacs
